---
{#- OpenShore (founder, 2026-11-10): the pitch and the ask.
    The site's home since 2026-11-16, word for word as it was at /enterprise/
    (founder: "a one-to-one replica"). How the product works is the platform
    page (/enterprise/platform/), led by the product tour. Since 2026-11-20
    (founder) the headline opens the page, under the tabs, with its picture;
    the film, with no caption under it, closes the opening. The open-shore
    line that sat under the film came off the site on 2026-11-24 (founder);
    its words are kept in src/_data/growWithUs.js. -#}
{%- set contact = site.enterpriseContact -%}
      <section class="ent-hero">
        {#- The opening (founder, 2026-11-20; laid side by side 2026-11-24 after
            a founder's cold read: the film should show above the fold, and
            there should be one clear next step). On a laptop the picture
            stands to the right of the headline, so the film rises into the
            first screen; on a phone it stays above the headline. The picture:
            a ring of TEAM, AI, AGENTS and APPS already turning, and the
            OpenShore mark surfacing in its middle (/enterprise/orbit.js). The
            words below are the ring's letters, laid out here for the script;
            they never show as rows. Without the script nothing shows. The
            button is the floating button's twin; the floating one steps aside
            while this one is on screen (data-float-spot). -#}
        <div class="ent-hero-top">
          <div class="orb" data-orb aria-hidden="true">
            <p class="orb-row"><span class="orb-x">your </span><span class="orb-w">team</span><span class="orb-x">,</span></p>
            <p class="orb-row"><span class="orb-w">AI</span> <span class="orb-w">agents</span></p>
            <p class="orb-row"><span class="orb-x">and </span><span class="orb-w">apps</span><span class="orb-x"> in one place.</span></p>
          </div>
          <div class="ent-hero-copy">
            <div class="ent-hero-text">
            <h1 class="ent-h1--wide"><span class="ent-h1-a">Grow your business, not your headcount.</span></h1>
            <p class="ent-lede">AI agents built by domain experts to work alongside your teams in sales ops, finance, supply chain, and more. They share one context across every app you use and run on any AI model, on a private server in your own cloud. Your data stays yours.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ent-actions" data-float-spot>
              <a class="ent-btn ent-btn--primary" href="/pricing/#design-partners">{{ pilot.button }}</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a class="ent-film ent-film--wide ent-film--hero" href="/enterprise/promo/" aria-label="Play the OpenShore film" data-film-embed data-film-title="The OpenShore film">
          <img src="/enterprise/promo-poster.jpg?v={{ rev.entPromoPoster }}" alt="" width="960" height="540" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <span class="ent-play" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 16" width="14" height="16"><path d="M1.5 1.2v13.6L13 8z" fill="currentColor" /></svg></span>
        </a>
      </section>

